sequenceDiagram
  participant O as Pedidos
  participant P as Pagos
  participant I as Inventario
  participant B as Bus de eventos
  O->>B: OrderCreated
  B->>P: OrderCreated
  P->>B: PaymentAuthorized
  B->>I: PaymentAuthorized
  I->>B: StockReserved
  B->>O: StockReserved
  O->>O: Confirmar pedido
